WEBVTT

00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:33.858
Now put your pencil down in
the middle of the paper, OK?

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.067
Look up at your partner.

00:02:35.067 --> 00:02:37.445
Look at the inside of one of their eyes.

00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:38.654
Doesn't matter which one.

00:02:38.696 --> 00:02:40.406
That's where you're going to start.

00:02:40.406 --> 00:02:41.574
Ready?

00:02:41.574 --> 00:02:42.742
Deep breath.

00:02:42.783 --> 00:02:43.951
(Inhales)

00:02:43.951 --> 00:02:45.578
And begin.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:48.831
Now, just draw but notice where you are,

00:02:48.831 --> 00:02:51.292
you're starting there
and you see there is a corner,

00:02:51.334 --> 00:02:52.710
maybe there's a curve there.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.129
Notice those little lines, the eyelashes.

00:02:55.171 --> 00:02:57.965
People are wearing masks,
some aren't, just work with that.

00:02:57.965 --> 00:02:59.550
Now just go slow.

00:02:59.592 --> 00:03:02.553
Pay attention and draw what you see.